# Files that exist in the repo but must never be served on the public domain.
# Vercel deploys the whole repo by default, so without this file every path
# below is fetchable by anyone who guesses the URL. Nothing here is linked
# from the site — that is not protection; unlinked is not unpublished.
#
# Keep in sync with the "Do not upload these" table in DEPLOY.md.

# ── NOT ignored: beta/ ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# beta/ is deliberately NOT listed here. It is the closed-beta waitlist page
# at /beta, it is in the sitemap, and it stays live.
#
# One thing to confirm about it, though. It carries a live publishable key for
# Supabase project pvqxsgqqlupldroooyhy — a DIFFERENT project from the app
# (fifnkgpxtnmjycxkkqhz), and one that never received the RLS migrations in
# sql/. It writes signup email / name / tiktok into a `waitlist` table.
# Anonymous SELECT there returns 200 with zero rows, which from outside is
# indistinguishable from an empty table, because Supabase filters rows rather
# than refusing the request. Check in the dashboard that `waitlist` has SELECT
# restricted to staff. If it does not, every signup email is readable by
# anyone who reads the page source for that key.

# ── Server-side code ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# No secrets are hardcoded in these (verified: only Deno.env.get names), so
# this is not a credential leak. But the migrations spell out every RLS policy
# on the database, and there is no reason to hand that map out.
sql/
supabase/

# ── Local build tooling ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
patch*.py
build_legal.py
_devserver.py
_rasterize.html
.claude/

# ── Design experiments and prototypes ────────────────────────────────────
# Not maintained, not security-reviewed, and some talk to a live database.
_glasstest/
faero_koi_30_v3.html

faero_liquid_metal_v4.html
# (It was the animated logo in the desktop's closed-beta popup. The desktop is
# gone and nothing loads it any more.)

# ── The retired faero OS desktop ─────────────────────────────────────────
# index.html is now a redirect to the app. The desktop's apps, its games,
# its old radio and its CSS/JS are no longer linked from anywhere, so they
# come off the public site. Two files in apps/ are still used by the app:
#   apps/photobooth.html     the Booth page
#   apps/faero-profiles.html the profile styles
apps/*
!apps/photobooth.html
!apps/faero-profiles.html
css/
js/

# ── Source documents ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# privacy.html / terms.html are the rendered pages and DO ship. These are the
# markdown they are generated from.
PRIVACY_POLICY.md
TERMS_OF_SERVICE.md
DEPLOY.md
BETA_LAUNCH_CHECKLIST.md
AUDIT_PROMPTS.md
README.md
